# Reference checkouts of other projects. They were committed as submodule
# pointers with no .gitmodules entry, so a fresh clone could not resolve them
# and `git submodule update` failed outright. Nothing here imports them.
viewer/svg-pcb/
viewer/circuitron/
viewer/kicad-tools/
viewer/cuflow/
viewer/faebryk/

# Playwright output: screenshots, traces and the last-run marker. Regenerated on
# every run, 42MB of it, and it made every test run show up as a dirty tree.
viewer/test-results/

# Router and exporter output: what the tools write beside the design they read.
#
# The `.dsn`, `.ses` and `.routes` files for three examples were tracked, and
# running `route` on any of them rewrote the lot - so they arrived in whatever
# commit came next, twice, one of which needed a commit of its own to put one
# back. Nothing reads them; they are what the tool produces, not what it is
# given.
*.routed.cypcb
*.dsn
*.ses
*.routes

